Synthetic data
--------------
All "LatamPay" content (customer pack, scenarios, SBOM, incidents) is entirely
fictional and synthetic. It is not real customer data. This lab is for education
and demonstration only and must not be used as a source of production security
decisions. Model outputs can be wrong; keep a human in the loop.
